{"name":"Contrail","hex":"#dedeff","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"contrail","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An artificial cloud made by the exhaust of jet aircraft or wingtip vortices that precipitate a stream of tiny ice crystals in moist, frigid upper air."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To produce an artificial cloud of this kind."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/contrail"}],"entries":[{"title":"Contrail","blocks":[{"text":"Contrails or vapour trails are line-shaped clouds produced by aircraft engine exhaust or changes in air pressure, typically at aircraft cruising altitudes several kilometres/miles above the Earth's surface. They are composed primarily of water, in the form of ice crystals. The combination of water vapor in aircraft engine exhaust and the low ambient temperatures at high altitudes cause the trails' formation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Jet-contrails-tokyosky-japan-2018.webm/330px--Jet-contrails-tokyosky-japan-2018.webm.jpg","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contrail"},{"title":"Contrail (horse)","blocks":[{"text":"Contrail  is a champion Japanese Thoroughbred racehorse who won the Japanese Triple Crown in 2020. He was one of the leading two-year-olds in Japan in 2019 when he was undefeated in three races including the Tokyo Sports Hai Nisai Stakes and Hopeful Stakes. In 2020 he maintained his unbeaten record with wins in the Satsuki Sho, Tokyo Yushun and Kobe Shimbun Hai before completing the Japan Triple Crown with a victory in the Kikuka Sho. Additionally, he won the 2021 Japan Cup in his final race, having come second to Almond Eye the previous year."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Contrail_2019_hopeful_stakes_honbaba_nyujyou.jpg/330px-Contrail_2019_hopeful_stakes_honbaba_nyujyou.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contrail_(horse)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg/500px-Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg/1280px-Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg/500px-Qantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Contrails of a Boeing 747-438 from Qantas at 11,000 m (36,000 ft)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AQantas_Boeing_747-400_VH-OJU_over_Starbeyevo_Kustov.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Propeller_tip_vortices_being_generated_by_P-40N1_Warhawk_VH-ZOC_at_Temora.jpg/500px-Propeller_tip_vortices_being_generated_by_P-40N1_Warhawk_VH-ZOC_at_Temora.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Propeller_tip_vortices_being_generated_by_P-40N1_Warhawk_VH-ZOC_at_Temora.jpg/500px-Propeller_tip_vortices_being_generated_by_P-40N1_Warhawk_VH-ZOC_at_Temora.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A vintage P-40 Warhawk with propeller tip vortex condensation","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APropeller_tip_vortices_being_generated_by_P-40N1_Warhawk_VH-ZOC_at_Temora.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg/500px-10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg/1280px-10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg/500px-10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A distrail is the opposite of a contrail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A10sec_old_Distrail_in_Hong_Kong.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Yoshito-Yahagi20110319.jpg/500px-Yoshito-Yahagi20110319.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Yoshito-Yahagi20110319.jpg/500px-Yoshito-Yahagi20110319.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Contrail's trainer Yoshito Yahagi","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYoshito-Yahagi20110319.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg/500px-Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg/1280px-Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg/500px-Hopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Contrail's regular jockey Yuichi Fukunaga","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHopeful_stakes_Yuichi-Fukunaga_20191228.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/2021-11-30_41th_Japan_Cup.jpg/500px-2021-11-30_41th_Japan_Cu